#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:53
#: ed6d353ea9184cad9d3d82c8c95e4355
msgid ""
"`arx_acone` is **Acone** (dual-arm). Full-body **ARX Lift 2S** "
"(`arx_lift2s`) uses `split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` on the"
" `arx-lift2s` branch — see [ARX Lift "
"2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md). **Taku** "
"(`taku`) uses the same split / full launches after descriptions are on "
"`feature/agilex`: public mock is `split_body.launch.py`; "
"`full_body.launch.py` needs the private `ocs2_wbc_controller` submodule —"
" [Taku / `feature/agilex`](../../1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md). "
"HighTorque Panthera HT launch name is `panthera_ht` — see [HighTorque "
"Panthera HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md). Keep "
"`demo.launch.py` for `cr5` / `arx_acone` / `panthera_ht`."
msgstr ""
"`arx_acone` 是 **Acone**（双臂）。全身 **ARX Lift 2S**（`arx_lift2s`）在 `arx-"
"lift2s` 分支上使用 `split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` — 见 [ARX "
"Lift 2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)。**Taku**"
"（`taku`）在描述切到 `feature/agilex` 后使用同一套分体 / 全身启动：公开 mock 是 "
"`split_body.launch.py`；`full_body.launch.py` 需要私有 `ocs2_wbc_controller` "
"子模块 — [Taku / `feature/agilex`](../../1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md)。"
"高擎 Panthera HT 的启动名是 `panthera_ht` — 见 [高擎 Panthera "
"HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)。`cr5` / "
"`arx_acone` / `panthera_ht` 仍用 `demo.launch.py`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:55
#: 61857933790940219d1e9a6e021e5033
msgid "End-effectors (`type` / `left_type` / `right_type`)"
msgstr "末端执行器（`type` / `left_type` / `right_type`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:57
#: 134a1817c7bc4e4abc62a2df43a710dd
msgid ""
"There is **no** `gripper:=` argument. End-effectors are selected by "
"**`robot_common_launch`**:"
msgstr "没有 **`gripper:=`** 参数。末端由 **`robot_common_launch`** 选择："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:59
#: 60bc0812ec4c4274bad6e9794b8cdc38
msgid "Symmetric EEF: `type:=<eef_key>`"
msgstr "对称末端：`type:=<eef_key>`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:60
#: 540f67a221044845b605d91b8c180665
msgid ""
"Different left / right: `left_type:=` and `right_type:=` together; **do "
"not pass `type:=`** then (`create_eef_side_launch_arguments()`)"
msgstr ""
"左右不同：同时传 `left_type:=` 与 `right_type:=`；此时**不要再传 "
"`type:=`**（`create_eef_side_launch_arguments()`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:61
#: 17b258f1269c482c973fb3620657dcad
msgid ""
"`type` may also be arm topology `left` / `right` / `dual` (that does "
"**not** become `left_type` / `right_type`)"
msgstr ""
"`type` 也可以是臂拓扑 `left` / `right` / `dual`（**不会**展开成 `left_type` / "
"`right_type`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:62
#: ad9cde9dfba041c29378db18be92c302
msgid ""
"OCS2 `demo` / `split_body` / `full_body` declare these via "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`. `basic_joint_controller` "
"`demo.launch.py` only declares `type`."
msgstr ""
"OCS2 的 `demo` / `split_body` / `full_body` 通过 "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()` 声明这些参数。`basic_joint_controller`"
" 的 `demo.launch.py` 只声明 `type`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:64
#: 5218b6b85a61455aae81de4c4b5c7630
msgid ""
"Profile YAML `defaults.end_effectors` is applied when "
"`use_profile_eef:=true` (default). Set `use_profile_eef:=false` to force "
"the CLI keys. Merge order: **CLI > profile > xacro defaults**. FT (`ft` /"
" `left_ft` / `right_ft`) and TCP offsets are separate and always take the"
" profile unless CLI overrides them."
msgstr ""
"`use_profile_eef:=true`（默认）时应用 profile YAML 的 `defaults.end_effectors`。设 "
"`use_profile_eef:=false` 以强制使用命令行键。合并顺序：**CLI > profile > xacro "
"默认值**。力传感器（`ft` / `left_ft` / `right_ft`）和 TCP 偏移是独立项，除非 CLI 覆盖，否则始终使用 "
"profile。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:66
#: 5230083d12414bd0898af95189fbca5d
msgid ""
"# README: ignore profile EEF, set L/R from CLI\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py \\\n"
"  robot:=<robot_name> \\\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  use_profile_eef:=false \\\n"
"  left_type:=rg75 right_type:=linkerhand_o7"
msgstr ""
"# README: ignore profile EEF, set L/R from CLI\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py \\\n"
"  robot:=<robot_name> \\\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  use_profile_eef:=false \\\n"
"  left_type:=rg75 right_type:=linkerhand_o7"

